---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Layout title="Tuscany Retreat — SolScape Retreats" description="Rolling hills, vineyards, and intentional movement in Central Italy. Barre, meditation, and Tuscan magic. Returning 2026.">

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Hero
       ============================================================ -->
  <div class="detail-hero">
    <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523531294919-4bcd7c65624d?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1920&q=80');"></div>
    <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="sub">Central Italy &nbsp;·&nbsp; Tuscany</p>
      <h1>Tuscany<br>Retreat</h1>
      <div class="dates-badge">Season One Complete &nbsp;·&nbsp; Returning 2026</div>
      <img src={`${base}/images/branding/solscape-logo.png`} class="hero-brand-mark" alt="SolScape">
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Overview
       ============================================================ -->
  <section style="background: var(--cream);">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="overview-grid">
        <div class="overview-text">
          <p class="section-label">Overview</p>
          <h2 class="section-title">Stillness in the <em>golden hills</em></h2>
          <div class="divider"></div>
          <p>Season one of our Tuscany retreat was, to use a word we try not to overuse, perfect. A farmhouse in the hills south of Florence. Rolling landscape in every direction. Olive groves, vineyards, and a silence so full it almost has a sound of its own.</p>
          <p>Days were structured but spacious. Morning barre on the terrace as the mist cleared. Meditation and journaling before breakfast. Long afternoons that turned into walks through the Val d'Orcia, or visits to hilltop towns, or simply time at the pool with a book. Sound baths at dusk. Dinners that went on as long as they needed to.</p>
          <p>Season two is coming back. Register now for early access when dates are announced.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="facts-card">
            <h4>Retreat at a Glance</h4>
            <div class="fact-row">
              <span class="fact-label">Status</span>
              <span class="fact-value" style="color: var(--mocha);">Season One Complete</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fact-row">
              <span class="fact-label">Next Dates</span>
              <span class="fact-value">2026 (TBC)</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fact-row">
              <span class="fact-label">Location</span>
              <span class="fact-value">Val d'Orcia, Tuscany</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fact-row">
              <span class="fact-label">Duration</span>
              <span class="fact-value">6 days / 5 nights</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fact-row">
              <span class="fact-label">Group Size</span>
              <span class="fact-value">Max 10 people</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fact-row">
              <span class="fact-label">Level</span>
              <span class="fact-value">All levels welcome</span>
            </div>
            <a href="#inquiry" class="btn btn-primary">Register Interest</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Accommodation
       ============================================================ -->
  <section style="background: var(--linen);">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">Where You'll Stay</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">A farmhouse in the <em>Val d'Orcia</em></h2>
      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="accom-gallery">
        <img class="main-img" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476514525405-8d8a77980a5e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Tuscan farmhouse with vineyard views">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505693416388-ac5ce068fe85?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Rustic Tuscan bedroom">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1414235077428-338989a2e8c0?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Italian farm-to-table dinner">
      </div>
      <div class="accom-text">
        <p>We stayed in a converted farmhouse — a classic Tuscan casa colonica — deep in the Val d'Orcia, a UNESCO-listed landscape of cypress avenues, wheat fields, and medieval hill towns. The property has been restored with care: terracotta floors, exposed beams, antique furniture, and a kitchen garden that feeds directly onto the dinner table.</p>
        <p>There is a heated pool with views over the valley, a shaded loggia for morning sessions, and enough outdoor space that the group could always find a quiet corner. Evenings were almost ceremonially beautiful — the light, the hills, the table set under the stars.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Included / Not Included
       ============================================================ -->
  <section style="background: var(--cream);">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">What's Covered</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Included &amp; <em>not included</em></h2>
      <div class="inc-exc-grid">
        <div class="inc-list">
          <h4>Included</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>5 nights accommodation in private en-suite room</li>
            <li>All breakfasts and four group dinners (farm-to-table)</li>
            <li>Daily barre and meditation sessions</li>
            <li>Guided Val d'Orcia walking experience</li>
            <li>Hilltop town excursion (Montalcino or Pienza)</li>
            <li>Sound bath and evening journaling circles</li>
            <li>Wine pairing dinner with local producers</li>
            <li>Welcome gift bag</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="exc-list">
          <h4>Not Included</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Flights to/from Florence or Rome</li>
            <li>Airport/station transfers (we can assist)</li>
            <li>Travel insurance (required)</li>
            <li>Lunches and additional meals out</li>
            <li>Personal purchases, olive oil, wine to take home</li>
            <li>Spa treatments</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Inquiry Form
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="inquiry-section" id="inquiry">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="form-card">
        <h3>Register Your Interest</h3>
        <p>Season two dates are being confirmed. Leave your details and we'll notify you first — with priority access to book your spot.</p>
        <form class="inquiry-form" name="inquiry-tuscany" data-netlify="true" novalidate>
          <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="inquiry-tuscany">
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="name">Full Name</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" placeholder="Your name" required name="name">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email Address</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required name="email">
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
              <input type="tel" id="phone" placeholder="+1 000 000 0000" name="phone">
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="retreat">Retreat</label>
              <select id="retreat" name="retreat">
                <option value="tuscany" selected>Tuscany — 2026 (TBC)</option>
                <option value="croatia">Croatia — May 2026</option>
                <option value="spain">Spain — 2026 (TBC)</option>
              </select>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-group">
            <label for="message">Anything we should know?</label>
            <textarea id="message" placeholder="Tell us about your practice, any questions, or what drew you to Tuscany…" name="message"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width:100%; text-align:center;">Register Interest</button>
        </form>
        <div class="form-success">
          Thank you — you're on the list. We'll be in touch as soon as Tuscany dates are confirmed ✦
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ============================================================
       SECTION: Other Retreats
       ============================================================ -->
  <section class="other-retreats">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="section-label">More Destinations</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">Explore other <em>retreats</em></h2>
      <div class="other-retreat-cards">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-banner" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555990793-da11153b2473?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');">
            <div class="card-location"><small>Adriatic Coast</small>Croatia</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-dates"><span class="card-status-dot"></span>Upcoming — May 10–15, 2026</p>
            <p class="card-desc">Yoga, barre, and sound baths on the Dalmatian coast.</p>
            <a href={`${base}/retreats/past/croatia`} class="card-link">Retreat details →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-banner" style="background-image: url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558618666-fcd25c85cd64?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80');">
            <div class="card-location"><small>Catalonia</small>Spain</div>
          </div>
          <div class="card-body">
            <p class="card-dates" style="color: var(--mocha);">Season One Complete · Returning 2026</p>
            <p class="card-desc">Art, culture, and movement in the hills of Catalonia.</p>
            <a href={`${base}/retreats/past/spain`} class="card-link">Retreat details →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
